  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flood Response in Nimba and Rivercess Counties, Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In response to ongoing flooding in Nimba and Rivercess counties, NCJPC Liberia, working with CAFOD, CDOM and Caritas Gbarnga, will address immediate needs of the affected population through multi-purpose cash assistance (MPCA). NCJPC will provide MPCA to 250 households (approx, 1,250 individuals) through mobile money or cash payments facilitated by financial partners. Each affected household will receive a $160 as a one-time cash transfer to cover their basic needs for a period of three months. MPCA has been chosen as an approach that empowers families to prioritize their most pressing needs with dignity and autonomy.</narrative>
  </description>
